{"suttaId":"tha-ap313","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[9230,9240],"vripara":"1"},"segments":{"tha-ap313:0.3":"Ārakkhadāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap313:1.1":"“Dhammadassissa munino, vati kārāpitā mayā;","tha-ap313:1.3":"Ārakkho ca mayā dinno, dvipadindassa tādino.","tha-ap313:2.1":"“Aṭṭhārase kappasate, yaṃ kammamakariṃ tadā;","tha-ap313:2.3":"Tena kammavisesena, patto me āsavakkhayo.","tha-ap313:3.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso, vimokkhāpi ca aṭṭhime;","tha-ap313:3.3":"Chaḷabhiññā sacchikatā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap313:4.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā ārakkhadāyako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap313:5.1":"Ārakkhadāyakattherassāpadānaṃ paṭhamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
